# Keep line endings consistent (LF) across platforms so `npm run format:check`
# (Prettier's endOfLine: "lf") passes everywhere, including Windows. The repo blobs are
# already LF; this stops git's core.autocrlf from smudging text files to CRLF on checkout
# (which otherwise makes format:check fail on Windows after any checkout/merge).
# Binary files (images, fonts, etc.) are auto-detected by `text=auto` and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
